{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39944","headline":"忆荐福寺南院 · 徐夤","name":"忆荐福寺南院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔长安落第春，佛宫南院独游频。\n灯前不动惟金像，壁上曾题尽古人。\n鶗鴂声中双阙雨，牡丹花际六街尘。\n啼猨溪上将归去，合问昇平诣秉钧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39944.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39944","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}